# This root deploy is the Bilingual Agents landing (Variant A) ONLY.
# Everything it needs at the root: index.html, privacy/terms/thank-you/booked.html,
# logo.png, og.png, robots.txt, sitemap.xml, llms.txt, vercel.json.
# Every sibling project in this workspace is excluded so their large assets
# (raw video, node_modules, .next caches, .db files) never enter the upload
# and never trip Vercel's 100 MB per-file limit.

